<title>UK: Bodycote analysts' meeting on Brukens buy.</title>
<headline>Bodycote analysts' meeting on Brukens buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bodycote International Plc said it would hold a briefing for share analysts on its acquisition of Swedish heat treatment group Brukens at 1000 GMT on Thursday in London.</p>
<p>The meeting will take place at Bodycote's brokers, Kleinwort Benson Securities Ltd, 20 Fenchurch St.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
